member.remarks:
Creates a new staff member (Cashier, Warehouse) with the provided registration details. Only users with Admin role are authorized to perform this action.
Sample request: POST /api/admin/staff-creation Authorization: Bearer {admin-token} Content-Type: application/json
{ "email": "cashier@electrostock.com", "password": "SecurePass123!", "firstName": "Jane", "lastName": "Doe", "phoneNumber": "01234567890", "dateOfBirth": "1995-05-15", "userRole": "Cashier" }

Validates user credentials (email/phone + password) and returns a JWT token for subsequent authenticated API requests. The token includes user role claims for authorization purposes.
Sample request: POST /api/authentication/login Content-Type: application/json
{ "identifier": "admin@electrostock.com", "password": "Admin123!" }

Creates a new completed invoice with the specified items.
Cashiers and Admins are authorized to perform this action.

Sample request:
POST /api/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {token}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
  "orderSource": "InStore",
  "paymentMethod": "Cash",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
      "quantity": 2,
      "serialNumber": null
    }
  ]
}

Creates a new quantified product with stock quantity tracking. Quantified products are tracked by quantity (e.g., 100 units of USB-C cables) rather than individual serial numbers. Only users with Admin role are authorized to perform this action.
Sample request: POST /api/product/quantified Authorization: Bearer {admin-token} Content-Type: application/json
{ "sku": "CBL-USBC-001", "brand": "Anker", "name": "USB-C Fast Charging Cable", "category": "Accessories", "model": "A1234", "unitCost": 8.50, "unitPrice": 19.99, "initialQuantity": 100, "minimumStockLevel": 20 }

Creates a new reservation for a customer, reserving stock for a single product (MVP design). Stock is reserved but not yet deducted from inventory. Cashiers and Admins are authorized to perform this action.
Sample request: POST /api/reservation Authorization: Bearer {token} Content-Type: application/json
{ "productId": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6", "quantity": 2, "firstName": "John", "lastName": "Doe", "phoneNumber": "01234567890", "source": "InStore" }

For serialized products (e.g., smartphones, tablets), each unit is unique and tracked by serial number/IMEI. This endpoint creates and receives the serialized product . Only users with Warehouse or Admin roles are authorized to perform this action.
Sample request: POST /api/stock/IPHONE-15-PRO/receive/serialized Authorization: Bearer {token} Content-Type: application/json
{ "brand": "Apple", "name": "iPhone 15 Pro", "category": "Smartphone", "model": "A2848", "unitCost": 850.00, "unitPrice": 999.99, "serialNumber": "SN-1234567890", "imei": "354123456789012", "warrantyPeriod": "OneYear" }

Updates the password for the currently authenticated user. Requires both old and new passwords. The new password must meet security requirements. All authenticated users (any role) are authorized to perform this action.
Sample request: PUT /api/user/change-password Authorization: Bearer {token} Content-Type: application/json
{ "oldPassword": "OldPass123!", "newPassword": "NewSecurePass456!" }
